// How sleep and rest speed time up (E §4.3). The clock is Earth's: a game second is a real
// second, the day 86,400 s, the tropical year 365.2422 days, the synodic month 29.530589 days,
// the sun, the moon and the stars where they really stand (`hearth_env::astro`).
(
    schema: 1,
    // Sleeping or resting speeds time up smoothly instead of skipping it (v2 §9.5).
    sleep: (max_factor: 100.0, ramp_s: 3.0),
)
